","rawTrack":"Singularis - RAF","track":{"id":"Sc8GEPxJQgA","path":"/artists/singularis/tracks/raf/","slug":"raf","title":"RAF","artist":{"slug":"singularis","title":"Singularis"},"artwork":"images/artists/singularis/tracks/raf.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"o27ZYCf_aK0","slug":"all-day-2021","tags":[6,3,19],"links":{"appleMusic":"https://music.apple.com/gb/station/soulection-all-day-joe-kay/ra.1546296427","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/sets/soulection-all-day"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection All Day 2021","artwork":"images/episodes/487-5-joe-kay.jpg","content":"**🎊🌟 Happy New Year 2021 🌟🎊**\n\nA day of exclusive mixes from [Joe Kay](/episodes/all-day-2021/#joe-kays-set), [Austin Marc](/episodes/all-day-2021/#austin-marcs-set), [Minzi Roberta](/episodes/all-day-2021/#minzi-robertas-set), and [See Dee](/episodes/all-day-2021/#see-dees-set).\n\n<!--more-->\n\n#### Jump to:\n\n- [Joe Kay's Set](/episodes/all-day-2021/#joe-kays-set) - Los Angeles 🇺🇸\n- [Austin Marc](/episodes/all-day-2021/#austin-marcs-set) - New York 🇺🇸\n- [Minzi Roberta](/episodes/all-day-2021/#minzi-robertas-set) - Toronto 🇨🇦\n- [See Dee](/episodes/all-day-2021/#see-dees-set) - Paris 🇫🇷\n\n\nAlso listen to [Soulection All Day 2020](/episodes/all-day-2020/), or [Soulection All Day 2019](/episodes/all-day-2019/).\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":28800,"location":"US","published_at":"2021-01-01T01:00:00+00:00"},"title":"minzi roberta's Set","position":2}},{"id":"ZOak-2VkGsI","position":24,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"singularis - Youneedtoknowmyname","track":{"id":"jtHph1hFzMM","path":"/artists/singularis/tracks/youneedtoknowmyname/","slug":"youneedtoknowmyname","title":"Youneedtoknowmyname","artist":{"slug":"singularis","title":"Singularis"},"artwork":""},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"W3k2t5eT5Eo","slug":"170","tags":[5,1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-170-w-eden-hagos-andre-power"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #170 w/ Eden Hagos & Andre Power","artwork":"/images/episodes/170.jpg","content":"Andre Power covers while Joe Kay is at Coachella.\n<!--more-->\n\nThese two did a great job of playing a variety of soulful classics along with new discoveries. This show is definitely on that deep thought vibe. Joe will be back this Saturday to continue on the progression. Spread the word, tell a friend.\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10900,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-04-12T01:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Eden's Set","position":2}},{"id":"gTdgvDQEtWY","position":17,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"SINGULARiS - Shadows","track":{"id":"ikrcpi2yT30","path":"/artists/singularis/tracks/shadows/","slug":"shadows","title":"Shadows","artist":{"slug":"singularis","title":"Singularis"},"artwork":"images/artists/singularis/tracks/shadows.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"eMlUtMnJUio","slug":"176","tags":[8,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-176-rinse-fm-launch"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #176 (RINSE FM Launch)","artwork":"/images/episodes/176.jpg","content":"\n<!--more-->\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10778,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-06-21T01:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Session","position":0}},{"id":"UmJ6FNPY9gg","position":2,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"SINGULARiS - RAIN","track":{"id":"ovcV1TYBRrM","path":"/artists/singularis/tracks/rain/","slug":"rain","title":"Rain","artist":{"slug":"singularis","title":"Singularis"},"artwork":"images/artists/singularis/tracks/rain.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"tG9uuDVmGUg","slug":"187","tags":[8,3,15],"links":{"archive":"https://www.dropbox.com/s/ovf1eltmps8df9t/187%20Show%20%23187%20w_%20Sango.mp3?dl=0","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-187-w-sango"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #187 w/ Sango","artwork":"/images/episodes/187.jpg","content":"\n<!--more-->\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10945,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-10-04T18:00:09+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"h4KiVQNHn-M","position":5,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"SINGULARiS - RAIN","track":{"id":"ovcV1TYBRrM","path":"/artists/singularis/tracks/rain/","slug":"rain","title":"Rain","artist":{"slug":"singularis","title":"Singularis"},"artwork":"images/artists/singularis/tracks/rain.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"M2wkPVc9GEQ","slug":"188","tags":[8,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-188-w-lakim"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #188 w/ LAKIM","artwork":"/images/episodes/188.jpg","content":"\n<!--more-->\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10620,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-10-11T01:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Session","position":0}},{"id":"dDWa7aPi7Zk","position":10,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Singularis - Head Up","track":{"id":"xtqKBoie8iQ","path":"/artists/singularis/tracks/head-up/","slug":"head-up","title":"Head Up","artist":{"slug":"singularis","title":"Singularis"},"artwork":"images/artists/singularis/tracks/head-up.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"HYh1pKyFzn0","slug":"191","tags":[8,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-191-w-mr-carmack"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #191 w/ Mr. Carmack","artwork":"/images/episodes/191.jpg","content":"It's been long over due but we were finally able to get Carmack one on one. \n<!--more-->\n\nHe is definitely one of the most forward thinking artists of the new generation. If you produce then there is a good chance that you know who Carmack is. He has inspired many all over the world and has pretty much created his own genre of sound. How many times have you heard another producer make a beat similar to his and say to yourself, \"CARMACK\"!?\n\nThis guy has been a big part of Soulection's growth and history and it felt good to finally sit down with my bro to talk about his growth and current inspirations. We talked about how his move to L.A. changed his life, how he feels about other producers who create music that sounds like his, his relationship with drugs and why he calls his music drugs, when we can expect the next album, and much more.\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10740,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-11-01T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kays's Session","position":1}},{"id":"HrsIlV-2vso","position":25,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Singularis - Snow","track":{"id":"JumJikSzHU4","path":"/artists/singularis/tracks/snow/","slug":"snow","title":"Snow","artist":{"slug":"singularis","title":"Singularis"},"artwork":"images/artists/singularis/tracks/snow.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"HYh1pKyFzn0","slug":"191","tags":[8,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-191-w-mr-carmack"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #191 w/ Mr. Carmack","artwork":"/images/episodes/191.jpg","content":"It's been long over due but we were finally able to get Carmack one on one. \n<!--more-->\n\nHe is definitely one of the most forward thinking artists of the new generation. If you produce then there is a good chance that you know who Carmack is. He has inspired many all over the world and has pretty much created his own genre of sound. How many times have you heard another producer make a beat similar to his and say to yourself, \"CARMACK\"!?\n\nThis guy has been a big part of Soulection's growth and history and it felt good to finally sit down with my bro to talk about his growth and current inspirations. We talked about how his move to L.A. changed his life, how he feels about other producers who create music that sounds like his, his relationship with drugs and why he calls his music drugs, when we can expect the next album, and much more.\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10740,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-11-01T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kays's Session","position":1}},{"id":"77QWj7-BxnY","position":32,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Singularis - Snow","track":{"id":"JumJikSzHU4","path":"/artists/singularis/tracks/snow/","slug":"snow","title":"Snow","artist":{"slug":"singularis","title":"Singularis"},"artwork":"images/artists/singularis/tracks/snow.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"F4e7aih12WM","slug":"199","tags":[8,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/show-199"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #199 (Best of 2014)","artwork":"/images/episodes/199.jpg","content":"\n<!--more-->\n\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":11825,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-12-27T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay’s Session","position":0}},{"id":"VULAm2BXCao","position":89,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Singularis - Head Up","track":{"id":"xtqKBoie8iQ","path":"/artists/singularis/tracks/head-up/","slug":"head-up","title":"Head Up","artist":{"slug":"singularis","title":"Singularis"},"artwork":"images/artists/singularis/tracks/head-up.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"F4e7aih12WM","slug":"199","tags":[8,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/show-199"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #199 (Best of 2014)","artwork":"/images/episodes/199.jpg","content":"\n<!--more-->\n\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":11825,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-12-27T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay’s Sessio